# A benchmark run's own output. `bench/results/` holds the ones that were kept on
# purpose, so only the default filename a run drops beside the script is ignored —
# the three paths here before named scripts that moved into bench/ or were deleted.
/tests/bench/benchmark.csv
/tests/bench/*.csv
!/tests/bench/results/*.csv
